        "tags": [
          "memory"
        ],
        "summary": "Record Answer Adoption Endpoint",
        "description": "采纳反馈闭环（P1-①）：回答文本引用本轮注入概念名/别名 → 权重/边权 +0.02。\n\nweave-mem 无 chat 流，由接入方在回答定稿时显式调用（ingest/clarify 同款\n模式）；入参 injected_ids 取 recall?include_meta=true 的 meta.memory_ids。\n写回 fail-open：返回摘要，绝不 500 拖垮调用方主流程。",
        "operationId": "record_answer_adoption_endpoint_api_memory_adoption_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object",
                "title": "Body"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
